        "id": 0,
        "original_id": "9c15336f-2f97-5162-a5f9-8f6dd6c2f027",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Companies: Mandalay Resort Group, Circus Circus Enterprises, MGM Resorts International, RBG, LLP, Hyatt\n- Places: Paradise, Nevada, Las Vegas, Elgin\n- Properties: Circus Circus Las Vegas, Grand Victoria Casino Elgin\n\nFacts:\n- Mandalay Resort Group, formerly known as Circus Circus Enterprises, was a hotel-casino operator based in Paradise, Nevada.\n- MGM Resorts International owns and operates Circus Circus Las Vegas.\n- In April 2005, MGM Resorts International acquired Mandalay Resort Group, which had previously been the 50% partner company in Grand Victoria Casino Elgin.\n- Grand Victoria Casino Elgin is 50% owned and operated by RBG, LLP, a subsidiary of Hyatt.\n- Grand Victoria Casino Elgin is also 50% owned by a subsidiary of MGM Resorts International.",
